        "controller_support": "full",
        "detailed_description": "<i>&quot;In a world where the past never dies, the battlefield is the only place that holds the answers. Surviving isn’t enough: discover who you truly are and face your fears.&quot;</i><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837230/extras/68795453c5d7746fd89e951f2806a5eb.webp?t=1759771517\" width=97 height=42 /></span> <strong>The past never dies…</strong><br><br>Set years after the events of Biomech Hell, Codename: Black Crow follows Aurora, a young soldier trained by the war legends Rock and Stan — better known as Thunderflash.<br>Once a child soldier in a remote area of Mexico, Aurora carries a painful past, revealed through focused, impactful dialogues and illustrated hi-res anime-style scenes that enrich the game’s retro atmosphere.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837230/extras/68795453c5d7746fd89e951f2806a5eb.webp?t=1759771517\" width=97 height=42 /></span> <strong>Old-school Action-RPG with an arcade soul!</strong><br><br>Codename: Black Crow is the direct sequel to Thunderflash and Biomech Hell, reinvented with a fresh formula blending fast-paced run &amp; gun arcade action with exploration, crafting, and light RPG mechanics.<br>Start with a knife and a handful of rations in a hostile land swarming with enemies. Use your radar to explore over 100 areas, gather resources, clear outposts, find new gear, and craft upgrades at workbenches.<br>Level up, unlock new blueprints, and face off against brutal bosses and challenges.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837230/extras/68795453c5d7746fd89e951f2806a5eb.webp?t=1759771517\" width=97 height=42 /></span> <strong>Includes Thunderflash 2!</strong><br><br>Codename: Black Crow was originally planned as Thunderflash 2, a pure arcade-style sequel even more fast-paced and explosive than the original. But as the story expanded, the project grew into something bigger — a new, standalone adventure for Aurora.<br>We didn’t want to leave Thunderflash 2 behind though, so it’s been integrated as an unlockable bonus inside Codename: Black Crow. Complete the main campaign to unlock this retro shooter experience.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837230/extras/68795453c5d7746fd89e951f2806a5eb.webp?t=1759771517\" width=97 height=42 /></span> <strong>Key Features:</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A mature, emotional story filled with powerful moments.<br></li><li>Fight, explore, gather materials, and craft upgrades.<br></li><li>Unlock new equipment to access fresh paths and tactics.<br></li><li>Discover 3 different endings.<br></li><li>Conquer enemy outposts and face brutal bosses.<br></li><li>Unlock Thunderflash 2, the direct sequel to Thunderflash!<br></li><li>Authentic 16-bit pixel art style.<br></li><li>Gorgeous hand-drawn illustrations by Coconut Art.<br></li><li>Tons of achievements to unlock.</li></ul><br>",
        "about_the_game": "<i>&quot;In a world where the past never dies, the battlefield is the only place that holds the answers. Surviving isn’t enough: discover who you truly are and face your fears.&quot;</i><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837230/extras/68795453c5d7746fd89e951f2806a5eb.webp?t=1759771517\" width=97 height=42 /></span> <strong>The past never dies…</strong><br><br>Set years after the events of Biomech Hell, Codename: Black Crow follows Aurora, a young soldier trained by the war legends Rock and Stan — better known as Thunderflash.<br>Once a child soldier in a remote area of Mexico, Aurora carries a painful past, revealed through focused, impactful dialogues and illustrated hi-res anime-style scenes that enrich the game’s retro atmosphere.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837230/extras/68795453c5d7746fd89e951f2806a5eb.webp?t=1759771517\" width=97 height=42 /></span> <strong>Old-school Action-RPG with an arcade soul!</strong><br><br>Codename: Black Crow is the direct sequel to Thunderflash and Biomech Hell, reinvented with a fresh formula blending fast-paced run &amp; gun arcade action with exploration, crafting, and light RPG mechanics.<br>Start with a knife and a handful of rations in a hostile land swarming with enemies. Use your radar to explore over 100 areas, gather resources, clear outposts, find new gear, and craft upgrades at workbenches.<br>Level up, unlock new blueprints, and face off against brutal bosses and challenges.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837230/extras/68795453c5d7746fd89e951f2806a5eb.webp?t=1759771517\" width=97 height=42 /></span> <strong>Includes Thunderflash 2!</strong><br><br>Codename: Black Crow was originally planned as Thunderflash 2, a pure arcade-style sequel even more fast-paced and explosive than the original. But as the story expanded, the project grew into something bigger — a new, standalone adventure for Aurora.<br>We didn’t want to leave Thunderflash 2 behind though, so it’s been integrated as an unlockable bonus inside Codename: Black Crow. Complete the main campaign to unlock this retro shooter experience.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837230/extras/68795453c5d7746fd89e951f2806a5eb.webp?t=1759771517\" width=97 height=42 /></span> <strong>Key Features:</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A mature, emotional story filled with powerful moments.<br></li><li>Fight, explore, gather materials, and craft upgrades.<br></li><li>Unlock new equipment to access fresh paths and tactics.<br></li><li>Discover 3 different endings.<br></li><li>Conquer enemy outposts and face brutal bosses.<br></li><li>Unlock Thunderflash 2, the direct sequel to Thunderflash!<br></li><li>Authentic 16-bit pixel art style.<br></li><li>Gorgeous hand-drawn illustrations by Coconut Art.<br></li><li>Tons of achievements to unlock.</li></ul><br>",
        "short_description": "Aurora never had a choice. Raised on the battlefield as a child soldier, now the past is back. Codename: Black Crow combines the relentless pace of top-down arcade shooters with RPG progression and a personal, emotional story.",
